('housing-abe-brown-insphire',TRUE,NULL::boolean,FALSE,TRUE,NULL::boolean,NULL::integer,NULL::integer,365,'https://abebrown.org/insphire-become-a-client/','813-247-3285','18+ with justice-system/lived incarceration experience; returning to Hillsborough, Pinellas, Pasco or Polk; drug-free and able to work full time. No sexual-offense convictions. Habitual violent-offender classification generally excluded, with some circumstances reviewed individually.'),
